<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were active, prices were steady.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 67.00-68.50.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-4 975-1200 lbs 66.50-68.50.</p>
</text>
